#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_system(system_id, sector, galaxy)
#         Registers a star system in the interstellar mesh.
#
#    - create_volume(name, size_mb, systems)
#         Creates a federated volume across multiple star systems.
#
#    - write(volume_id, data)
#         Distributes shards across systems and galaxies.
#
#    - read(volume_id, shard_ids, origin_system)
#         Automatically selects best repair path based on interstellar topology.
#
#    - snapshot(volume_id)
#         Creates an interstellar snapshot.
#
#    - restore(snapshot_id)
#         Restores shard map from snapshot.
#
#    - engine_snapshot()
#         Returns interstellar mesh state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  STAR SYSTEM FORMAT:
#
